BEGIN_PGML Let [`A = \{2, 4, 6, 8\}\text{.}`] Suppose [`B`] is a set with [`|B| = 5\text{.}`] a. What are the smallest and largest possible values of [`|A \cup B|\text{?}`] Explain.
[@KeyboardInstructions('[_]{5}{5} [` \le |A \cup B| \le `] [_]{9}{5}')@]**
a. What are the smallest and largest possible values of [`|A \cap B|\text{?}`] Explain.
[@KeyboardInstructions('[_]{0}{5} [` \le |A \cap B| \le `] [_]{4}{5}')@]**
a. What are the smallest and largest possible values of [`|A \times B|\text{?}`] Explain.
[@KeyboardInstructions('[_]{20}{5} [` \le |A \times B| \le `] [_]{20}{5}')@]**
